# User data and generated outputs
/Catchments/
/Output/
/Output_*/
/*_Input/
/*_backup/
/examples/synthetic/output/
/examples/synthetic/inputs_generated/
/examples/*/data/
/examples/*/output/

# User-supplied tables and workbooks are private by default. The distributed
# templates and synthetic inputs below are deliberate exceptions.
*.csv
*.xlsx
!input_templates/*.csv
!examples/synthetic/inputs/**/*.csv

# MATLAB temporary and compiled files
*.asv
*.m~
*.mex*
*.fig
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.pdf

# Operating-system and editor files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*

# CSV templates and synthetic example inputs are intentionally tracked.
